# Same keys and {placeholders} as lang/en.lang, in the same order; only the text between them
# is translated. The notes on each section are lang/en.lang's, kept in English for whoever
# edits this file. Every line is translated: test_lang_files_match fails on one left out.
# Written in UTF-8, and kept that way: Chinese is drawn in the Unicode codepage (src/glyphs.odin)
